'''Betakkuma''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that only appears in the [[Betakkuma Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Betakkuma
|image = E 415.png
|appearance = [[Betakkuma Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 360¢ - 1,422¢
}}

==Enemy==
Bettakuma has somewhat high health and DPS for early-game players, but all of his other stats are pathetic; extremely low attack power and range, as well as Single Target. His only real strengths are his 50% chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] cats and his fast attack rate.

==Strategy==
This enemy can be beaten through using any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]].

